<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-INTER'S ANGLOMA SIGNS FOR VALENCIA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INTER'S ANGLOMA SIGNS FOR VALENCIA.</headline>
<dateline>VALENCIA, Spain 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish club Valencia said on Thursday they had signed former French international defender Jocelyn Angloma from Inter Milan.</p>
<p>Angloma, a member of the Serie A team who lost last season's UEFA Cup final to German club Schalke, has been overlooked by French national coach Aime Jacquet since last year's European championship in England.</p>
